/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Microeconometrics\072\040Methods\040and\040Applications)
/Author (A\056\040Colin\040Cameron\054\040Pravin\040K\056\040Trivedi)
/Subject (This\040book\040provides\040the\040most\040comprehensive\040treatment\040to\040date\040of\040microeconometrics\054\040the\040analysis\040of\040individual\055level\040data\040on\040the\040economic\040behavior\040of\040individuals\040or\040firms\040using\040regression\040methods\040for\040cross\040section\040and\040panel\040data\056\040The\040book\040is\040oriented\040to\040the\040practitioner\056\040A\040basic\040understanding\040of\040the\040linear\040regression\040model\040with\040matrix\040algebra\040is\040assumed\056\040The\040text\040can\040be\040used\040for\040a\040microeconometrics\040course\054\040typically\040a\040second\055year\040economics\040PhD\040course\073\040for\040data\055oriented\040applied\040microeconometrics\040field\040courses\073\040and\040as\040a\040reference\040work\040for\040graduate\040students\040and\040applied\040researchers\040who\040wish\040to\040fill\040in\040gaps\040in\040their\040toolkit\056\040Distinguishing\040features\040of\040the\040book\040include\040emphasis\040on\040nonlinear\040models\040and\040robust\040inference\054\040simulation\055based\040estimation\054\040and\040problems\040of\040complex\040survey\040data\056\040The\040book\040makes\040frequent\040use\040of\040numerical\040examples\040based\040on\040generated\040data\040to\040illustrate\040the\040key\040models\040and\040methods\056\040More\040substantially\054\040it\040systematically\040integrates\040into\040the\040text\040empirical\040illustrations\040based\040on\040seven\040large\040and\040exceptionally\040rich\040data\040sets\056)
/Keywords (09\040May\0402005\054\040University\040of\040California\054\040Davis\054\040Indiana\040University)
>>
